<title>USA: Trinity, Transcisco okay deal.</title>
<headline>Trinity, Transcisco okay deal.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trinity Industries Inc and Transcisco Industries Inc said in a joint statement that Transcisco's shareholders have approved the merger agreement with Trinity.</p>
<p>Transcisco shareholders received 0.1884 shares of Trinity for each share of Transcisco, the companies said.</p>
<p>The transaction, which was valued at $47.6 million when it was first announced in June, closed today, the companies said.</p>
</text>
